      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "author": "Riley Cho <riley.cho@harborviewexpo.org>",
      "subject": "Fwd: voicemail from 'mobile support': is this real?",
      "shortSummary": "Riley forwards a suspicious call transcript for review.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "Asha,\n\nI caught this between two badge runs and did not call back. It felt wrong, so I saved the transcript.\n\n---\nCaller: This is Harborview mobile support. Your LanternPass number is scheduled for a security lockout.\nRiley: I didn't request a lockout.\nCaller: Then read me the one-time code so I can cancel it before your badge is disabled.\n---\n\nRiley",
      "attachements": []
    }
  ]
